    "description": "This is the first package-verified Continuous Graph preview candidate. It builds trusted, registered PostgreSQL 19 SQL/PGQ plans on the existing BlueTusk property-graph, Live, and Control Plane foundations without exp…",
    "route": "/documentation/graph/continuous-graph-release-notes-0-1-0-preview-1",
